    "A quick introduction to your location timeline." :     {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "A quick introduction to your location timeline."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A route looks straight or the mode is wrong" :     {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "A route looks straight or the mode is wrong"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A route on the map can come from recorded GPS, an imported track, or a route inferred from map directions. Map matching changes display geometry; it does not turn inferred connector points into recorded location samples." :     {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "A route on the map can come from recorded GPS, an imported track, or a route inferred from map directions. Map matching changes display geometry; it does not turn inferred connector points into recorded location samples."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A route that cannot be matched keeps its recorded coordinates when available. Network or routing failures do not prove that no terrestrial route exists." :     {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "A route that cannot be matched keeps its recorded coordinates when available. Network or routing failures do not prove that no terrestrial route exists."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A straight connector can be inferred display geometry, particularly for flights or when detailed route points are unavailable." :     {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "A straight connector can be inferred display geometry, particularly for flights or when detailed route points are unavailable."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A visit can have a label for that occurrence. A Regular Place is a saved named area, such as Home or Work, that can match visits within its radius." :     {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "A visit can have a label for that occurrence. A Regular Place is a saved named area, such as Home or Work, that can match visits within its radius."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A visit or move is missing" :     {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "A visit or move is missing"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A visit represents time associated with a place. A move represents travel between places. Sparse system observations are not exact departure or arrival times, so inferred move timing can be approximate." :     {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "A visit represents time associated with a place. A move represents travel between places. Sparse system observations are not exact departure or arrival times, so inferred move timing can be approximate."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Allow the location permissions requested by iOS and keep Location Services enabled. iOS controls when background updates are delivered; Moves cannot guarantee a point at every moment." :     {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Allow the location permissions requested by iOS and keep Location Services enabled. iOS controls when background updates are delivered; Moves cannot guarantee a point at every moment."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An integration sends data outside Moves and your private iCloud container. Review the destination, server address, and credentials before enabling uploads. Existing history may require a separate upload action." :     {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "An integration sends data outside Moves and your private iCloud container. Review the destination, server address, and credentials before enabling uploads. Existing history may require a separate upload action."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Appearance settings can show raw operating-system location fixes or reconstructed routes. Raw fixes are observations and are not joined into a recorded route." :     {
